8ac5990f2255e6d9464063ed0de5d84e6a4cd840029a69.jpg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "id": 93, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 33}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [], "label": "IMAGE", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "IMAGE"}, {"name": "MASK", "label": "MASK", "type": "MASK", "localized_name": "MASK"}], "size": [2973.1748046875, 4142.5], "pos": [-3075.032958984375, -4236.435546875], "widgets_values": ["f6980cf20581e1671f71246f264eb81905f4af0ddd81b43c3d74630b82ce0b0f.jpeg", "image"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "image"}, "name": "image", "label": "image", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "upload"}, "name": "upload", "label": "upload", "type": "IMAGEUPLOAD", "localized_name": "choose file to upload"}], "flags": {"pinned": true, "collapsed": false}, "id": 94, "type": "LoadImage", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "LoadImage"}, "order": 34}, {"outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [66], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "STRING"}], "color": "#3f384f", "widgets_values": ["你是一位擅长将图像转化为精准生图提示词的分析师。你的工作流程：先读图，再提炼，最后用中文写出一段可直接用于AI生图的提示词。\n\n## 第一步：读图（内部判断，不输出）\n\n按以下优先级观察图像，权重从高到低：\n1. 主体：人物/物体是什么，姿态、表情、状态、与画面的关系\n2. 光影：主光方向与性质（硬光/柔光/逆光/侧光），色温倾向，阴影形态\n3. 氛围：整体情绪基调（温暖/冷清/紧张/宁静/怀旧/梦幻……）\n4. 构图：视角（平视/仰视/俯视），主体位置（居中/三分/边缘），视觉引导线\n5. 空间层次：前景（是否有遮挡/虚化物）、中景（主体层）、远景（背景纵深）\n6. 质感细节：材质纹理、焦外虚化程度、颗粒感、色调偏移\n\n## 第二步：判断风格方向（二选一，不输出判断过程）\n\n- 若图像具有明显的布光、构图设计感和视觉张力 → 走「艺术电影感」路线，使用：cinematic、controlled lighting、color grading、shallow DOF等镜头语言\n- 若图像呈现随手拍、自然光、轻微失焦或构图随意 → 走「日常业余感」路线，使用：amateur snapshot、available light、slight motion blur、imperfect framing、film grain等语言\n\n## 第三步：输出提示词（唯一输出内容）\n\n格式要求：\n- 纯中文，无水印描述，无括号标注，无总结语，无分隔线\n- 以主体动作为起点，按\"主体→光影→氛围→构图→空间层次→质感\"顺序展开\n- 每个维度用1-3句具体描述，避免空洞形容词\n- 总字数不超过800字\n\n描述规范：\n- 用具体名词替代模糊形容词（如\"暖橘色夕阳侧光\"而非\"好看的光\"）\n- 光影必须写明方向和性质（如\"从画面左上方斜射的柔光\"而非\"光线很好\"）\n- 构图必须写明视角和主体位置（如\"低角度仰拍，人物位于画面右三分之一处\"而非\"构图不错\"）\n- 氛围用场景+色调+情绪三要素锁定（如\"雨后街道，青灰色调，安静孤独感\"而非\"很有氛围\"）", "Qwen3-VL-8B-Instruct-FP8", "none", false, 0.7, 2048, 200704, 1003520, 1085, "randomize", "eager"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "source_path", "label": "source_path", "type": "PATH", "localized_name": "source_path"}, {"shape": 7, "name": "image", "link": 70, "label": "image", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "image"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}, {"widget": {"name": "model"}, "name": "model", "label": "model", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "model"}, {"widget": {"name": "quantization"}, "name": "quantization", "label": "quantization", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "quantization"}, {"widget": {"name": "keep_model_loaded"}, "name": "keep_model_loaded", "label": "keep_model_loaded", "type": "BOOLEAN", "localized_name": "keep_model_loaded"}, {"widget": {"name": "temperature"}, "name": "temperature", "label": "temperature", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "temperature"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_new_tokens"}, "name": "max_new_tokens", "label": "max_new_tokens", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_new_tokens"}, {"widget": {"name": "min_pixels"}, "name": "min_pixels", "label": "min_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "min_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "max_pixels"}, "name": "max_pixels", "label": "max_pixels", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "max_pixels"}, {"widget": {"name": "seed"}, "name": "seed", "label": "seed", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "seed"}, {"widget": {"name": "attention"}, "name": "attention", "label": "attention", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "attention"}], "flags": {"pinned"